{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976578461,"sessionID":"ses_1ccbea1e8ffek7hg3qX3TOMFfa","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_yC25xiD2jIgc9P1krygAiSAv","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Added the requested articular cartilage zonal chondrocyte terms in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: in the current ontology source, the existing articular chondrocyte term is `CL:1001607`; `CL:0002557` is a different term in this checkout. The new terms were therefore parented to `CL:1001607`.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+This PR adds four new child terms under `articular chondrocyte` (`CL:1001607`) for the depth-dependent zones of articular cartilage:\n+\n+- `superficial zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `middle zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `deep zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `calcified zone articular chondrocyte`\n+\n+Each new term includes a referenced definition, requested synonyms where applicable, contributor ORCID `0000-0003-0098-4399`, `GitHub Copilot` creator metadata, a creation timestamp, and an issue tracker annotation linking to issue #3533.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+\n+- The issue requested conservative zonal subtypes of articular chondrocyte.\n+- PubMed context was checked for PMID:41226342, PMID:18455690, and PMID:23124445. `aurelian fulltext` was attempted as requested by project guidance, but the command is not installed in this environment, so PubMed/web-accessible article pages were used instead.\n+- The issue text identified `CL:0002557` as articular chondrocyte, but in this ontology checkout `CL:0002557` is `fibroblast of pulmonary artery`; the existing articular chondrocyte term is `CL:1001607`, so the new classes were parented there.\n+\n+Completed checklist:\n+\n+- Checked the existing articular chondrocyte hierarchy and confirmed the correct parent term in this source file.\n+- Checked for existing zonal articular chondrocyte labels before adding new terms.\n+- Added new `CL_99xxxxx` IDs as required for NTRs.\n+- Added definitions with PMID xrefs.\n+- Added synonyms with references.\n+- Added contributor, creator, date, and issue tracker annotations.\n+- Validated OWL functional syntax with `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-test.owl`.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Added the requested articular cartilage zonal chondrocyte terms in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: in the current ontology source, the existing articular chondrocyte term is `CL:1001607`; `CL:0002557` is a different term in this checkout. The new terms were therefore parented to `CL:1001607`.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@\n+This PR adds four new child terms under `articular chondrocyte` (`CL:1001607`) for the depth-dependent zones of articular cartilage:\n+\n+- `superficial zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `middle zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `deep zone articular chondrocyte`\n+- `calcified zone articular chondrocyte`\n+\n+Each new term includes a referenced definition, requested synonyms where applicable, contributor ORCID `0000-0003-0098-4399`, `GitHub Copilot` creator metadata, a creation timestamp, and an issue tracker annotation linking to issue #3533.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+\n+- The issue requested conservative zonal subtypes of articular chondrocyte.\n+- P